  "see_also": [],
  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": null,
    "grammar": "**Also** has a fixed place in the sentence: before the main verb (*I also know*), after **be** (*I am also tired*), and after the first helping verb (*I have also seen it*). Learners often put it at the end, where **too** belongs.",
